# SMS (messaging.sms.twilio): Twilio Programmable Messaging. Without these three settings nothing is sent and every
# message is logged as "not sent" (no text is written anywhere). TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER is your Twilio number in E.164
# (+15551234567); or set TWILIO_MESSAGING_SERVICE_SID instead. Point the number's "A message comes in" webhook to
# https://<your app>/api/messaging/sms/webhook so STOP / START replies are honoured. APP_URL (or BETTER_AUTH_URL) must
# be the public origin Twilio calls, because the webhook signature covers the full URL.
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER=
TWILIO_MESSAGING_SERVICE_SID=
